e, and most expert raters lean Democratic, though a couple still tilt Republican. Bouchard holds a clear fundraising and cash-on-hand edge, while Hines has drawn outside support. The race sits on the Democratic side of tossup territory, with real uncertainty in both directions.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6628, "margin": 2.54}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6491, "margin": 2.0}]}